flowchart TD
  O[Admitted semantic objective O*] --> D[DfCM frontier]
  D --> G[ggen deterministic manufacture]
  G --> C[Capability resolver]
  C --> S[SwarmSH bounded execution cells]
  S --> R[Receipts and observations]
  R --> K[Capitalization candidates]
  K --> M[ggen marketplace]
  M --> G
